const GRAMMAR_NORM_FULL = "# Oxford Grade 4 LevelUp - U1/U2 文法範圍總整理\n## AI 出題規範 (Gemini Flash 3.8 專用)\n\n> 來源：你目前內建教材 courseData 共 84 詞 (U1:31, U2:53)\n> 目標：鎖死教材範圍，題型為單選選擇題，考驗文法掌握\n\n---\n\n### 一、總覽\n\n**U1: Fun Outdoors (戶外活動) - 31 詞**\n核心文法：動名詞 Gerund、喜好與專長、祈使句與安全\n**U2: Land and Sea (海陸生物) - 53 詞**\n核心文法：名詞複數、冠詞、比較級/最高級、同級比較、疑問句型、介系詞\n\n---\n\n\n### A. 動名詞 Gerund (U1 核心) (14 條規則)\n\n**動名詞** | `fish 變成 fishing`\n- 說明：直接在字尾加上 -ing。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['fish']\n- 例句：My dad and I like fishing.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：fish\n\n**動名詞** | `grill 變成 grilling`\n- 說明：直接在字尾加上 -ing。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['grill hamburgers']\n- 例句：We like grilling hamburgers.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：grill hamburgers\n\n**動名詞** | `watch 變成 watching`\n- 說明：直接在字尾加上 -ing。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['watch birds']\n- 例句：She likes watching birds.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：watch birds\n\n**動名詞與喜好** | `What does he like doing? He likes climbing.`\n- 說明：動詞後加上 -ing 變為動名詞。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['climb']\n- 例句：He likes climbing trees.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：climb\n\n**動名詞變化** | `hike 變成 hiking`\n- 說明：字尾為 e 的動詞，去掉 e 再加 -ing。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['hike']\n- 例句：They like hiking up the hill.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：hike\n\n**動名詞變化** | `ice-skate 變成 ice-skating`\n- 說明：去掉字尾 e 再加 -ing。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['ice-skate']\n- 例句：Are you good at ice-skating?\n- 涵蓋詞彙：ice-skate\n\n**動名詞變化** | `in-line skate 變成 in-line skating`\n- 說明：去掉字尾 e 再加 -ing。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['in-line skate']\n- 例句：He likes in-line skating.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：in-line skate\n\n**動名詞變化** | `swim 變成 swimming`\n- 說明：短母音+單子音，重複字尾 m 加 ing。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['swim']\n- 例句：He likes swimming.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：swim\n\n**動名詞變化** | `run 變成 running`\n- 說明：短母音+單子音，重複字尾 n 加 ing。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['run']\n- 例句：She likes running.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：run\n\n**動名詞變化** | `dance 變成 dancing`\n- 說明：去掉字尾 e 再加 -ing。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['dance']\n- 例句：They like dancing.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：dance\n\n**動名詞變化** | `cook 變成 cooking`\n- 說明：一般動詞直接加 -ing。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['cook']\n- 例句：I like cooking.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：cook\n\n**動名詞變化** | `sing 變成 singing`\n- 說明：一般動詞直接加 -ing。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['sing']\n- 例句：We are good at singing.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：sing\n\n**動名詞變化** | `read 變成 reading`\n- 說明：一般動詞直接加 -ing。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['read']\n- 例句：He is good at reading.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：read\n\n**動名詞變化** | `draw 變成 drawing`\n- 說明：一般動詞直接加 -ing。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['draw']\n- 例句：She is good at drawing.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：draw\n\n\n### B. 喜好與專長表達 (U1) (5 條規則)\n\n**Do/Does 疑問句** | `Yes, she likes it a lot.`\n- 說明：詢問特定喜好使用 Does。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['canoe']\n- 例句：Does she like canoeing?\n- 涵蓋詞彙：canoe\n\n**一般疑問句** | `No, she's not very good at it.`\n- 說明：使用 Is/Are 詢問專長。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['surf']\n- 例句：Is she good at surfing?\n- 涵蓋詞彙：surf\n\n**表達專長** | `Yes, he's very good at it.`\n- 說明：be good at 加上動名詞。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['ski']\n- 例句：Is he good at skiing?\n- 涵蓋詞彙：ski\n\n**表達專長** | `He is good at skateboarding.`\n- 說明：be good at 加上動名詞。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['skateboard']\n- 例句：He is good at skateboarding.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：skateboard\n\n**表達專長 (否定)** | `She isn't good at snowboarding.`\n- 說明：be 動詞後加 not。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['snowboard']\n- 例句：She isn't good at snowboarding.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：snowboard\n\n\n### C. 祈使句與安全提醒 (U1) (8 條規則)\n\n**安全提醒** | `Always put on sunscreen.`\n- 說明：原形動詞開頭表示命令或建議。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['put on sunscreen']\n- 例句：Always put on sunscreen.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：put on sunscreen\n\n**感嘆祈使句** | `Watch out!`\n- 說明：用於緊急提醒。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['watch out']\n- 例句：Watch out for the rocks!\n- 涵蓋詞彙：watch out\n\n**時間副詞子句** | `When you go snowboarding...`\n- 說明：When 帶出時間點，後接祈使句。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['wear a helmet']\n- 例句：When you go snowboarding, always wear a helmet.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：wear a helmet\n\n**時間副詞子句** | `When you go canoeing...`\n- 說明：提醒安全規則。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['wear a life jacket']\n- 例句：When you go canoeing, wear a life jacket.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：wear a life jacket\n\n**時間副詞子句** | `When you ride in the car...`\n- 說明：確保乘車安全。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['fasten your seatbelt']\n- 例句：When you ride in the car, fasten your seatbelt.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：fasten your seatbelt\n\n**祈使句** | `Be careful.`\n- 說明：Be 動詞的祈使句保持原形。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['be careful']\n- 例句：Be careful on the ice.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：be careful\n\n**祈使句** | `Be safe.`\n- 說明：safe 是形容詞，前面需加上 Be 動詞。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['be safe']\n- 例句：Be safe outdoors.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：be safe\n\n**祈使句否定** | `Don't + 原形動詞`\n- 說明：用於安撫或勸告。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：[\"don't worry\"]\n- 例句：Don't worry, be happy.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：don't worry\n\n\n### D. 名詞複數 Plural Nouns (U2 核心) (12 條規則)\n\n**不規則複數** | `bacteria`\n- 說明：bacteria 本身即為複數形式 (單數為 bacterium)。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['bacteria']\n- 例句：It has bad bacteria in its mouth.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：bacteria\n\n**可數名詞** | `crocodiles`\n- 說明：複數直接加 s。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['crocodile']\n- 例句：The crocodile has sharp teeth.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：crocodile\n\n**可數名詞** | `distances`\n- 說明：複數直接加 s。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['distance']\n- 例句：They can walk long distances.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：distance\n\n**名詞字尾 f 或 fe** | `Replace 'f' or 'fe' with 'ves'`\n- 說明：字尾為 f 或 fe 時，去掉並加上 -ves。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['Grammar: Plural Nouns']\n- 例句：One wolf, two wolves.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：Grammar: Plural Nouns\n\n**名詞複數** | `butterflies`\n- 說明：子音+y 結尾，去 y 加 ies。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['butterfly']\n- 例句：The butterfly is smaller than the bird.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：butterfly\n\n**名詞複數** | `octopuses`\n- 說明：字尾 s 加 es。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['octopus']\n- 例句：The octopus is very heavy.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：octopus\n\n**名詞複數** | `kilograms`\n- 說明：大於 1 時要加 s。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['kilogram (kg)']\n- 例句：It weighs 5 kilograms.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：kilogram (kg)\n\n**名詞複數** | `grams`\n- 說明：大於 1 時要加 s。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['gram (g)']\n- 例句：1 kilogram is 1000 grams.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：gram (g)\n\n**名詞複數** | `meters`\n- 說明：大於 1 時要加 s。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['meter (m)']\n- 例句：It is 3 meters long.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：meter (m)\n\n**名詞複數** | `centimeters`\n- 說明：大於 1 時要加 s。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['centimeter (cm)']\n- 例句：1 meter is 100 centimeters.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：centimeter (cm)\n\n**複數名詞** | `scales`\n- 說明：通常以複數形態出現。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['scales']\n- 例句：Fish and reptiles have scales.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：scales\n\n**不規則變化** | `child -> children`\n- 說明：不加 s。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['Grammar: Irregular Plurals']\n- 例句：One child, two children.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：Grammar: Irregular Plurals\n\n\n### E. 冠詞 Articles (U2) (3 條規則)\n\n**冠詞用法** | `an insect`\n- 說明：母音開頭，前面用 an。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['insect']\n- 例句：A bee is an insect.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：insect\n\n**冠詞用法規則** | `We use a/an with singular nouns.`\n- 說明：子音開頭用 a，母音開頭用 an。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['Grammar: Articles (冠詞)']\n- 例句：I saw a lion and an elephant. The lion was scary.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：Grammar: Articles (冠詞)\n\n**冠詞與發音** | `an island`\n- 說明：s 不發音，母音開頭用 an。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['island']\n- 例句：They live on an island.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：island\n\n\n### F. 比較級 Comparative (U2) (6 條規則)\n\n**多音節形容詞** | `more + adjective`\n- 說明：前方加 more。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['Grammar: Comparatives']\n- 例句：Expensive becomes more expensive.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：Grammar: Comparatives\n\n**比較級** | `faster than`\n- 說明：一般單音節加 -er。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['bee']\n- 例句：The bee is faster than the caterpillar.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：bee\n\n**比較級** | `smarter than`\n- 說明：單音節加 -er。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['dolphin']\n- 例句：The dolphin is smarter than the shark.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：dolphin\n\n**比較級** | `faster than`\n- 說明：比較兩者特徵。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['squid']\n- 例句：The squid is faster than the crab.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：squid\n\n**比較級句型** | `bigger than`\n- 說明：big 需重複字尾 g 再加 -er。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['hippopotamus (hippo)']\n- 例句：The hippopotamus is bigger than the panda.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：hippopotamus (hippo)\n\n**雙音節且 -y 結尾** | `Drop -y and add -ier`\n- 說明：去 y 加 ier。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['Grammar: Comparatives']\n- 例句：Pretty becomes prettier.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：Grammar: Comparatives\n\n\n### G. 最高級 Superlative (U2) (3 條規則)\n\n**最高級** | `the longest`\n- 說明：單音節加 the ... -est。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['whale']\n- 例句：The whale is the longest.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：whale\n\n**最高級句型** | `the biggest`\n- 說明：最高級前面必須加上定冠詞 the。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['gorilla']\n- 例句：The gorilla is the biggest.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：gorilla\n\n**最高級疑問** | `Which one is the smallest?`\n- 說明：用 Which 詢問哪一個。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['caterpillar']\n- 例句：The caterpillar is the smallest.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：caterpillar\n\n\n### H. 同級比較 As...As (U2) (4 條規則)\n\n**同級比較** | `Is the eel as long as...?`\n- 說明：詢問兩者是否一樣長。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['eel']\n- 例句：Is the eel as long as the seal?\n- 涵蓋詞彙：eel\n\n**同級比較** | `as dangerous as`\n- 說明：使用 as + 原級 + as。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['shark']\n- 例句：The shark is as dangerous as the crocodile.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：shark\n\n**同級比較否定** | `isn't as big as`\n- 說明：使用 isn't as + 原級 + as。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['panda']\n- 例句：The panda isn't as big as the hippo.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：panda\n\n**同級比較否定** | `isn't as long as`\n- 說明：表示沒有和...一樣長。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['seal']\n- 例句：The seal isn't as long as the whale.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：seal\n\n\n### I. 疑問句型 Questions (U1+U2) (5 條規則)\n\n**疑問詞** | `Which one...`\n- 說明：用來詢問特定群體中的哪一個。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['which one']\n- 例句：Which one is the biggest?\n- 涵蓋詞彙：which one\n\n**疑問詞** | `How much...`\n- 說明：詢問重量或不可數名詞的數量。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['how much']\n- 例句：How much does it weigh?\n- 涵蓋詞彙：how much\n\n**疑問詞** | `How long...`\n- 說明：詢問時間或物品的長度。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['how long']\n- 例句：How long is it?\n- 涵蓋詞彙：how long\n\n**詢問重量** | `How much does...weigh?`\n- 說明：weigh 是動詞。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['beetle']\n- 例句：How much does the beetle weigh?\n- 涵蓋詞彙：beetle\n\n**詢問長度** | `How long is...?`\n- 說明：How long 詢問長度。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['lizard']\n- 例句：How long is the lizard?\n- 涵蓋詞彙：lizard\n\n\n### J. 介系詞與地方 (U1+U2) (6 條規則)\n\n**介系詞片語** | `be good at + V-ing`\n- 說明：at 是介系詞，後面接名詞或動名詞。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['be good at']\n- 例句：I am good at fishing.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：be good at\n\n**地方副詞** | `on the beach`\n- 說明：on 用於開放的表面。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['play on the beach']\n- 例句：They like playing on the beach.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：play on the beach\n\n**介系詞** | `in the ground`\n- 說明：在土地裡用 in。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['ground']\n- 例句：They sleep in holes in the ground.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：ground\n\n**介系詞片語** | `at work`\n- 說明：固定搭配用法。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['at work']\n- 例句：My dad is at work.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：at work\n\n**地方介系詞** | `at the aquarium`\n- 說明：at 用於特定的地點。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['aquarium']\n- 例句：We are at the aquarium.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：aquarium\n\n**地方介系詞** | `in Indonesia`\n- 說明：國家或大地方前用 in。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['Indonesia']\n- 例句：Komodo dragons live in Indonesia.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：Indonesia\n\n\n### K. 形容詞與名詞用法 (U2) (18 條規則)\n\n**動詞片語** | `ride in the car`\n- 說明：表示乘坐汽車的動作。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['ride in the car']\n- 例句：We ride in the car to the park.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：ride in the car\n\n**動詞與名詞** | `have rules`\n- 說明：rules 是可數名詞複數。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['have rules']\n- 例句：Games have rules.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：have rules\n\n**例外與不規則變化** | `good -> better`\n- 說明：個別記憶。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['Grammar: Irregular Adjectives']\n- 例句：Good, better, best.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：Grammar: Irregular Adjectives\n\n**動詞用法** | `weigh`\n- 說明：注意與名詞 weight 區分。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['weigh']\n- 例句：I weigh the apple.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：weigh\n\n**反問句型** | `What about...`\n- 說明：用來針對同樣的問題詢問不同的對象。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['what about']\n- 例句：What about the crab?\n- 涵蓋詞彙：what about\n\n**名詞片語** | `forked tongue`\n- 說明：用形容詞 forked 修飾 tongue。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['forked tongue']\n- 例句：It has a long forked tongue.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：forked tongue\n\n**名詞用法** | `weight`\n- 說明：不可數名詞。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['weight']\n- 例句：What is its weight?\n- 涵蓋詞彙：weight\n\n**名詞用法** | `length`\n- 說明：long 的名詞形態。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['length']\n- 例句：Measure the length.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：length\n\n**名詞用法** | `a male`\n- 說明：作為名詞代表雄性動物。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['male']\n- 例句：They don't need a male.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：male\n\n**專有名詞** | `Komodo`\n- 說明：字首大寫。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['Komodo dragon']\n- 例句：The Komodo dragon is dangerous.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：Komodo dragon\n\n**專有名詞** | `Pacific`\n- 說明：地名首字母大寫。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['giant Pacific octopus']\n- 例句：The giant Pacific octopus is smart.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：giant Pacific octopus\n\n**專有名詞** | `parthenogenesis`\n- 說明：科學名詞，通常作不可數使用。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['parthenogenesis']\n- 例句：This is called parthenogenesis.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：parthenogenesis\n\n**形容詞用法** | `rough skin`\n- 說明：形容詞放在名詞前面修飾。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['rough']\n- 例句：Komodo dragons have rough skin.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：rough\n\n**形容詞用法** | `thick scales`\n- 說明：形容詞放在名詞前面修飾。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['thick']\n- 例句：They have thick scales.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：thick\n\n**形容詞用法** | `a female dragon`\n- 說明：用來標示動物的性別。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['female']\n- 例句：A female dragon lays eggs.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：female\n\n**複合名詞** | `goliath beetle`\n- 說明：由兩個單字組成的名詞。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['goliath beetle']\n- 例句：The goliath beetle is big.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：goliath beetle\n\n**複合名詞** | `spider crab`\n- 說明：由兩個單字組成的名詞。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['spider crab']\n- 例句：The spider crab has long legs.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：spider crab\n\n**重量單位** | `grams`\n- 說明：超過 1 公克加 s。\n- 詞數：1 | 範例：['crab']\n- 例句：The crab weighs 500 grams.\n- 涵蓋詞彙：crab\n\n\n---\n\n### 二、詳細文法規則 (給 Gemini 的規範)\n\n#### A. 動名詞 Gerund - U1 核心 (10 條)\n\n**A1. 基本規則：V + -ing 變動名詞**\n- 一般動詞：fish → fishing, grill → grilling, watch → watching\n- 去 e 規則：hike → hiking, dance → dancing, skate → skating, ice-skate → ice-skating\n- 重複子音：swim → swimming (短母音+單子音), run → running\n- 用法：like/likes + V-ing (喜好), be good at + V-ing (專長)\n\n**A2. 出題考點：**\n- 正確：He likes climbing trees.\n- 錯誤陷阱：\n  - He likes climb trees. (少 -ing) → Grade 4 最常見錯誤\n  - He like climbing trees. (主詞不一致)\n  - He likes climbing tree. (複數錯誤)\n\n**A3. 允許句型：**\n- What does he like doing? He likes V-ing.\n- Does she like V-ing? Yes, she likes it a lot.\n- Is he good at V-ing? Yes, he's very good at it.\n- She isn't good at V-ing.\n\n---\n\n#### D. 名詞複數 Plural - U2 核心 (14 條)\n\n**D1. 規則分類：**\n\n| 類型 | 規則 | 範例 | 常見錯誤 |\n|------|------|------|----------|\n| 一般 | 直接 + s | crocodile → crocodiles, distance → distances | 漏 s |\n| s/es | s, x, sh, ch + es | octopus → octopuses, beach → beaches | 只加 s |\n| 子音+y | 去 y + ies | butterfly → butterflies | butterflys |\n| f/fe | f/fe → ves | wolf → wolves, life → lives? (本教材) | wolfs |\n| 不規則 | 個別記憶 | child → children, bacterium → bacteria | childs, bacteriums |\n| 單位詞 | kg/g/m/cm + s | 5 kilograms, 100 grams | 漏 s |\n\n**D2. 出題考點：**\n- Q: Look, two ____ over there.\n- 正確：wolves / butterflies / octopuses\n- 陷阱：wolf / wolfs / wolvies / butterflys\n\n**D3. 教材內複數詞：**\nbutterfly, octopus, crocodile, distance, bacteria, wolf, child, kilogram, gram, meter, centimeter, scales, life jacket 等\n\n---\n\n#### E. 冠詞 Articles\n\n**E1. a / an**\n- a + 子音開頭：a crocodile, a bee\n- an + 母音開頭：an insect, an island (s 不發音視為母音), an eel\n- 規則：We use a/an with singular nouns.\n\n**E2. 出題陷阱：**\n- A bee is an insect. (bee 用 a, insect 用 an)\n- 錯誤：A insect, An bee\n\n---\n\n#### F. 比較級 Comparative (U2)\n\n**F1. 單音節：**\n- 一般 + -er：fast → faster, smart → smarter, big → bigger (重複字尾)\n- 句型：A is bigger than B.\n\n**F2. -y 結尾雙音節：**\n- 去 y + ier：pretty → prettier\n\n**F3. 多音節：**\n- more + adj：expensive → more expensive\n\n**F4. 不規則：**\n- good → better → best\n\n**F5. 出題陷阱：**\n- 正確：The hippo is bigger than the panda.\n- 錯誤：more bigger (重複), big than (少 -er), more big than (多音節規則錯)\n\n---\n\n#### G. 最高級 Superlative\n\n- 規則：the + -est / the most + adj\n- 教材：the longest, the biggest, the smallest, the longest\n- 句型：The whale is the longest. Which one is the smallest?\n- 陷阱：漏 the, 用比較級代替最高級\n\n---\n\n#### H. 同級比較 As...As\n\n- 肯定：as + adj + as：The shark is as dangerous as the crocodile.\n- 否定：isn't as + adj + as：The panda isn't as big as the hippo.\n- 疑問：Is the eel as long as the seal?\n- 陷阱：漏 as, 用 than 代替 as, 漏 isn't\n\n---\n\n#### I. 疑問句型\n\n- Which one...? 詢問哪一個：Which one is the biggest?\n- How much...? 詢問重量/數量：How much does it weigh? How much does the beetle weigh?\n- How long...? 詢問長度：How long is it? How long is the lizard?\n- What about...? 反問：What about the crab?\n- Do/Does...?：Does she like canoeing? Is she good at surfing?\n\n---\n\n#### J. 祈使句與安全 (U1)\n\n- 祈使：Be careful. Be safe. Always put on sunscreen. Watch out!\n- 否定祈使：Don't + V：Don't worry, be happy.\n- 時間子句：When you go V-ing, ...：When you go snowboarding, always wear a helmet.\n- 出題：選正確祈使句，注意大小寫與 Be 動詞\n\n---\n\n### 三、AI 出題規範 (Gemini Flash 3.8)\n\n**Prompt 必須包含：**\n\n```\nSTRICT VOCAB LOCK:\nAllowed words: [84詞 + 功能詞 + Oxford Grade4 基礎詞]\nUnit: U1 或 U2\nFocus word: climb\nGrammar: 動名詞與喜好 - What does he like doing? He likes climbing. - 動詞後加上 -ing\n\nTASK: 單選選擇題，4選1，考文法不是翻譯\n\n要求：\n1. questionEn 必須是 Grade 4 自然句，含空格或 Wh-\n2. 4個選項全在允許詞表內，僅1正確，3個是常見文法錯誤（少 -ing、主詞不一致、複數錯、比較級錯）\n3. 回傳 JSON：questionEn, questionCn, options[4], correctIndex, explanationEn, explanationCn, grammarPoint, hintCn\n4. 禁止使用超綱詞：如 elephant, lion 等不在 U1/U2 的詞\n\n範例：\nQ: What does he like doing?\nA) He likes climb trees. (少 -ing) ❌\nB) He likes climbing trees. ✅\nC) He like climbing trees. (likes 錯) ❌\nD) He likes climbing tree. (複數錯) ❌\n```\n\n**驗證層：**\n- isSentenceInRange() 檢查每個 token 是否在 allowedVocab\n- 若超綱，重試1次或回退題庫\n\n**快取：**\n- Key: gemini_quiz_{word}_{grammarTitle}\n- TTL: 1小時\n\n**回退：**\n- 若無 API Key 或 Gemini 失敗 → 使用原本 generateChoices() 題庫模式\n\n---\n\n### 四、單字庫完整清單 (84詞)\n\n**U1 (31):** climb, hike, canoe, fish, grill hamburgers, watch birds, ski, snowboard, ice-skate, in-line skate, skateboard, surf, swim, run, dance, cook, sing, read, draw, ride in the car, have rules, play on the beach, put on sunscreen, watch out, wear a helmet, wear a life jacket, fasten your seatbelt, be careful, be safe, don't worry, be good at\n\n**U2 (53):** butterfly, beetle, eagle, hippopotamus (hippo), dolphin, shark, octopus, panda, wolf, Komodo dragon, giant Pacific octopus, crocodile, eel, seal, whale, gorilla, caterpillar, bee, crab, squid, spider crab, goliath beetle, lizard, bacteria, ground, aquarium, Indonesia, island, insect, weight, length, male, female, rough, thick, scales, forked tongue, goliath beetle, distance, which one, how much, how long, what about, kilogram, gram, meter, centimeter, weigh, at work, parthenogenesis, etc + Grammar: Plural Nouns, Irregular Plurals, Comparatives\n\n---\n\n### 五、文法考點對應表 (給 AI 出題用)\n\n| 文法 | 出題重點 | 錯誤干擾設計 |\n|------|----------|--------------|\n| Gerund | like + V-ing, be good at + V-ing | 少 -ing, 去 e 規則錯, 重複子音錯 |\n| Plural -s | crocodiles | 漏 s |\n| Plural -es | octopuses | octopus |\n| Plural y→ies | butterflies | butterflys |\n| Plural f→ves | wolves | wolfs |\n| Irregular | children, bacteria | childs, bacteriums |\n| a/an | an insect, an island | a insect, an bee |\n| Comparative -er | bigger than, faster than | big than, more bigger |\n| Comparative y→ier | prettier | more prettier |\n| Comparative more | more expensive | expensiver |\n| Superlative | the longest | longest (漏 the) |\n| As...As | as dangerous as | as dangerous than |\n| As...As 否定 | isn't as big as | isn't as big than |\n| Do/Does | Does she like...? | Do she...? |\n| Is/Are good at | Is he good at...? | Are he...? |\n| Imperative | Be careful. | Are careful. |\n\n---\n\n以上即為完整規範，Gemini 必須嚴格遵守，不可超出 Oxford Grade 4 LevelUp U1/U2 範圍。\n";


const ALLOWED_FUNCTION_WORDS = new Set([
  "i","you","he","she","it","we","they","my","your","his","her","its","our","their",
  "a","an","the","is","are","am","was","were","be","been","being",
  "do","does","did","have","has","had","can","could","will","would","should",
  "what","where","when","who","why","how","which",
  "not","n't","no","yes","very","good","bad","at","in","on","under","over","up","down",
  "to","for","of","with","and","or","but","so","than","as","like","about","from",
  "this","that","these","those","there","here","it","its","me","him","her","us","them",
  "one","two","lot","a lot","very","much","more","most","many","some","any","all"
]);

let allowedVocabCache = null;

function buildAllowedVocabSet() {
  if (allowedVocabCache) return allowedVocabCache;
  const vocabSet = new Set();
  // 從 courseData 提取所有單字和例句的詞
  Object.values(courseData).forEach(unitArray => {
    unitArray.forEach(entry => {
      // 單字本身
      entry.word.toLowerCase().split(/[\s\/]+/).forEach(w => {
        if (w) vocabSet.add(w.replace(/[^a-z]/g,''));
      });
      // 例句
      if (entry.example) {
        entry.example.toLowerCase().split(/\s+/).forEach(w => {
          const clean = w.replace(/[^a-z]/g,'');
          if (clean) vocabSet.add(clean);
        });
      }
      // 文法內容
      if (entry.grammar && entry.grammar.content) {
        entry.grammar.content.toLowerCase().split(/\s+/).forEach(w => {
          const clean = w.replace(/[^a-z]/g,'');
          if (clean) vocabSet.add(clean);
        });
      }
      // quiz expected
      if (entry.quiz && entry.quiz.expectedAnswer) {
        entry.quiz.expectedAnswer.toLowerCase().split(/\s+/).forEach(w => {
          const clean = w.replace(/[^a-z]/g,'');
          if (clean) vocabSet.add(clean);
        });
      }
    });
  });
  // 加上 function words
  ALLOWED_FUNCTION_WORDS.forEach(w => vocabSet.add(w));
  // Oxford Grade 4 LevelUp 額外允許的基礎詞（課本常見）
  ["outdoors","fun","aquarium","hill","birds","fishing","hamburger","snowboarding","helmet","sunscreen","life","jacket","tent","sleeping","bag","butterfly","beetle","eagle","hippopotamus","dolphin","shark","octopus","panda","wolf","wolves","child","children","scary","cute","big","bigger","small","smaller","pretty","prettier","expensive","more","less","good","better","best"].forEach(w => vocabSet.add(w));
  
  allowedVocabCache = vocabSet;
  return vocabSet;
}

function tokenizeSentence(sentence) {
  return sentence.toLowerCase().split(/\s+/).map(w => w.replace(/[^a-z']/g,'')).filter(Boolean);
}

function isSentenceInRange(sentence, allowedSet) {
  const tokens = tokenizeSentence(sentence);
  const outOfRange = [];
  for (const token of tokens) {
    if (!allowedSet.has(token) && !ALLOWED_FUNCTION_WORDS.has(token)) {
      // 允許 -ing, -s, -es 變化寬鬆檢查
      const base = token.replace(/(ing|es|s|ves)$/,'');
      if (!allowedSet.has(base) && !ALLOWED_FUNCTION_WORDS.has(base)) {
        outOfRange.push(token);
      }
    }
  }
  return { valid: outOfRange.length === 0, outOfRange };
}

function buildGeminiPrompt(currentWordEntry) {
  const allowedSet = buildAllowedVocabSet();
  const allowedList = Array.from(allowedSet).sort().slice(0, 250).join(', ');
  
  // 同單元的其他詞當干擾素材
  const sameUnitWords = (courseData[currentWordEntry.unit?.includes('1') ? 'U1' : 'U2'] || [])
    .slice(0, 12)
    .map(e => e.word)
    .join(', ');

  // 取得當前單字所屬的文法分類，找出相關規則
  const currentGrammarTitle = currentWordEntry.grammar.title;
  const relevantNorms = [];
  
  // 根據文法標題匹配規範中的相關段落
  if (currentGrammarTitle.includes('動名詞')) {
    relevantNorms.push('文法重點：動名詞 Gerund - V+ing, 去e規則, 重複子音, like/likes + V-ing, be good at + V-ing');
    relevantNorms.push('常見錯誤：He likes climb (少-ing), He like climbing (主詞不一致), hikeing→hiking, swiming→swimming');
  } else if (currentGrammarTitle.includes('複數') || currentGrammarTitle.includes('可數') || currentGrammarTitle.includes('不規則')) {
    relevantNorms.push('文法重點：複數 Plural - +s, +es (octopuses), y→ies (butterflies), f→ves (wolves), 不規則 children/bacteria');
    relevantNorms.push('常見錯誤：wolfs→wolves, butterflys→butterflies, childs→children, 漏s');
  } else if (currentGrammarTitle.includes('冠詞')) {
    relevantNorms.push('文法重點：a + 子音, an + 母音 (an insect, an island, an eel)');
    relevantNorms.push('常見錯誤：A insect→An insect, An bee→A bee');
  } else if (currentGrammarTitle.includes('比較級') || currentGrammarTitle.includes('比較')) {
    relevantNorms.push('文法重點：-er than (bigger than), y→ier (prettier), more + adj (more expensive), good→better');
    relevantNorms.push('常見錯誤：more bigger (重複), big than (少-er), expensiver, more prettier');
  } else if (currentGrammarTitle.includes('最高級')) {
    relevantNorms.push('文法重點：the + -est (the longest, the biggest), the most + adj, Which one is the smallest?');
    relevantNorms.push('常見錯誤：漏the → longest, 用比較級代替最高級');
  } else if (currentGrammarTitle.includes('同級')) {
    relevantNorms.push('文法重點：as + adj + as (as dangerous as), isn\'t as + adj + as (isn\'t as big as)');
    relevantNorms.push('常見錯誤：as dangerous than (用than錯), 漏as');
  }

  const prompt = `
${OXFORD_GRADE4_GRAMMAR_NORM}

=== 本次出題任務 ===

You are an expert English test designer for Oxford Level Up Grade 4 (Oxford Grade 4 LevelUp). You MUST follow the grammar norm above strictly.

STRICT CONSTRAINTS - MUST FOLLOW:
1. VOCABULARY LOCK: You can ONLY use words from this allowed list + basic function words. NEVER use words outside. Allowed (250 words sample): ${allowedList}. Same unit words: ${sameUnitWords}
2. TEXTBOOK: Oxford Grade 4 LevelUp, Unit: ${currentWordEntry.unit}
3. FOCUS WORD: ${currentWordEntry.word} (${currentWordEntry.partOfSpeech}) - ${currentWordEntry.translation}
   Example: ${currentWordEntry.example} (${currentWordEntry.exampleCn})
   Grammar: ${currentWordEntry.grammar.title} - ${currentWordEntry.grammar.content} - Note: ${currentWordEntry.grammar.note}
   Quiz reference: ${currentWordEntry.quiz.question} -> ${currentWordEntry.quiz.expectedAnswer}
4. RELEVANT GRAMMAR RULES FOR THIS WORD: ${relevantNorms.join(' | ')}

TASK: Create ONE multiple-choice question (single choice, 4 options) that TESTS GRAMMAR MASTERY, not just translation.

Grammar testing requirements for Oxford Grade 4:
- If grammar is about gerund (V-ing): test like/likes + V-ing, be good at + V-ing, common mistake: missing -ing, using base form, e-drop error, double consonant error
- If plural nouns: test -s/-es/-ves/irregular (wolf->wolves, butterfly->butterflies, child->children, octopus->octopuses), common mistake: wolfs, butterflys, childs, missing s
- If comparative: test -er than, more + adj, as...as, common mistake: more bigger, than missing, than/as confusion
- If article a/an: test a + consonant, an + vowel (an insect, an island), common mistake: A insect, An bee
- If Do/Does: test Does she/he vs Do you/they, common mistake: Do she?
- If superlative: test the + -est, common mistake: missing the
- If as...as: test as...as vs as...than, common mistake: using than

QUESTION FORMAT:
- QuestionEn: Can be fill-in-the-blank (Look, two ____ over there.) or Wh-question (What does he like doing?), must be natural Grade 4 level, within allowed vocab
- QuestionCn: Chinese translation of question
- Options: 4 full English sentences, all within allowed vocab, only 1 correct, 3 are grammatically wrong but plausible (targeting Grade 4 common mistakes from norm above)
- CorrectIndex: 0-3
- ExplanationEn: Why correct is correct, why others are wrong (simple English, mention grammar rule)
- ExplanationCn: 中文解釋，針對文法點，說明為什麼錯（例如：少 -ing、主詞不一致、複數錯誤、比較級重複）
- GrammarPoint: Which grammar point is tested (e.g., 動名詞與喜好 - like + V-ing)
- HintCn: 中文提示

EXAMPLES OF GOOD DISTRACTORS (must follow norm):

Example 1 - Gerund (動名詞與喜好):
Q: What does he like doing?
A) He likes climb trees. (wrong: missing -ing) ❌
B) He likes climbing trees. (correct) ✅
C) He like climbing trees. (wrong: subject-verb agreement, should likes) ❌
D) He likes climbing tree. (wrong: plural, should trees) ❌

Example 2 - Plural (名詞複數 - f→ves):
Q: Look, two ____ over there. They are scary.
A) wolf (wrong: should be plural) ❌
B) wolves (correct) ✅ - f→ves
C) wolfs (wrong: irregular, should wolves) ❌
D) wolvies (wrong) ❌

Example 3 - Plural (子音+y→ies):
Q: The ____ are smaller than the birds.
A) butterfly (wrong: should plural) ❌
B) butterflies (correct) ✅ - y→ies
C) butterflys (wrong) ❌
D) butterfliess (wrong) ❌

Example 4 - Comparative (比較級):
Q: A hippopotamus is ____ than a panda.
A) big (wrong: missing -er) ❌
B) bigger (wrong: missing than) ❌ - actually needs than, but option includes than in question
C) bigger than (correct if question is fill blank) / The hippo is bigger than the panda. ✅
D) more bigger than (wrong: double comparative) ❌

Example 5 - Article (冠詞):
Q: A bee is ____ insect.
A) a (wrong: insect vowel) ❌
B) an (correct) ✅
C) the (wrong: first mention) ❌
D) - (wrong) ❌

Example 6 - As...As (同級比較):
Q: The shark is ____ dangerous ____ the crocodile.
A) as...than (wrong: should as...as) ❌
B) as...as (correct) ✅
C) more...than (wrong: should as...as for equal) ❌
D) so...as (wrong: not for affirmative) ❌

RETURN ONLY JSON, no markdown, no explanation outside JSON, format:
{
  "questionEn": "What does he like doing?",
  "questionCn": "他喜歡做什麼？",
  "options": ["He likes climb trees.", "He likes climbing trees.", "He like climbing trees.", "He likes climbing tree."],
  "correctIndex": 1,
  "explanationEn": "We use 'likes + V-ing' for hobbies. 'climbing' is gerund. A missing -ing, C subject-verb error, D plural error.",
  "explanationCn": "表達喜好時，like 後面要加動名詞 V-ing，所以要用 climbing。選項 A 少了 -ing，C 主詞動詞不一致 (He likes不是like)，D 單複數錯誤 (trees不是tree)。",
  "grammarPoint": "動名詞與喜好 - like + V-ing",
  "hintCn": "他喜歡爬樹"
}

CRITICAL:
- All words in questionEn and options MUST be from allowed list. Check against norm.
- If you need a word not in allowed list, replace with allowed synonym from same unit.
- Focus on grammar, not vocabulary translation.
- Make distractors target Grade 4 common mistakes listed in norm.

Generate now for focus word: ${currentWordEntry.word}
`;

  return prompt;
}




const quizCache = new Map();

async function generateQuizWithGemini(currentWordEntry, retryCount = 0) {
  const cacheKey = `gemini_quiz_${currentWordEntry.word}_${currentWordEntry.grammar.title}`;
  
  // 檢查快取 (localStorage)
  try {
    const cached = localStorage.getItem(cacheKey);
    if (cached) {
      const parsed = JSON.parse(cached);
      // 快取 1 小時有效
      if (Date.now() - parsed.timestamp < 3600000) {
        addSystemLog('📦 使用快取題目: ' + currentWordEntry.word, false);
        return parsed.data;
      }
    }
  } catch (e) {}
  
  // 檢查記憶體快取
  if (quizCache.has(cacheKey)) {
    return quizCache.get(cacheKey);
  }

  const prompt = buildGeminiPrompt(currentWordEntry);
  const allowedSet = buildAllowedVocabSet();

  addSystemLog('🤖 Gemini Flash 3.8 出題中... (' + currentWordEntry.word + ')', false);

  try {
    currentTtsAbortController = new AbortController();
    
    // 嘗試主要模型
    let modelToUse = QUIZ_MODEL;
    let url = getApiUrl(modelToUse);
    
    const requestBody = {
      contents: [{ parts: [{ text: prompt }] }],
      generationConfig: {
        temperature: 0.7,
        maxOutputTokens: 1024,
        responseMimeType: "application/json"
      }
    };

    let response;
    try {
      response = await fetch(url, {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify(requestBody),
        signal: currentTtsAbortController.signal
      });
    } catch (e) {
      // 如果 3.8 不存在，回退到 2.5
      addSystemLog('⚠️ ' + QUIZ_MODEL + ' 失敗，嘗試 ' + QUIZ_MODEL_FALLBACK, true);
      modelToUse = QUIZ_MODEL_FALLBACK;
      url = getApiUrl(modelToUse);
      response = await fetch(url, {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify(requestBody),
        signal: currentTtsAbortController.signal
      });
    }

    // 如果主要模型 404，再試 fallback
    if (response.status === 404) {
      addSystemLog('⚠️ ' + QUIZ_MODEL + ' 404，回退到 ' + QUIZ_MODEL_FALLBACK, true);
      modelToUse = QUIZ_MODEL_FALLBACK;
      url = getApiUrl(modelToUse);
      response = await fetch(url, {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify(requestBody),
        signal: currentTtsAbortController.signal
      });
    }

    addSystemLog('📡 Gemini 回應: ' + response.status + ' (' + modelToUse + ')', false);
    
    const data = await response.json();
    
    if (!response.ok) {
      throw new Error(data.error?.message || 'Gemini API 失敗: ' + response.status);
    }

    let text = data.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts?.[0]?.text || '';
    // 清理 markdown
    text = text.replace(/```json/g,'').replace(/```/g,'').trim();
    
    let result;
    try {
      result = JSON.parse(text);
    } catch (e) {
      addSystemLog('❌ JSON 解析失敗: ' + text.substring(0,200), true);
      throw new Error('JSON 解析失敗');
    }

    // 驗證格式
    if (!result.questionEn || !result.options || result.options.length !== 4 || typeof result.correctIndex !== 'number') {
      throw new Error('格式錯誤');
    }

    // 嚴格驗證：是否超出教材範圍
    const validations = [];
    validations.push(isSentenceInRange(result.questionEn, allowedSet));
    result.options.forEach(opt => {
      validations.push(isSentenceInRange(opt, allowedSet));
    });

    const invalid = validations.filter(v => !v.valid);
    if (invalid.length > 0) {
      const outWords = invalid.flatMap(v => v.outOfRange).join(', ');
      addSystemLog('⚠️ 檢測到超綱詞彙: ' + outWords + '，嘗試修正...', true);
      if (retryCount < 1) {
        // 重試一次，帶上錯誤提示
        const retryPrompt = prompt + "\n\nPREVIOUS ATTEMPT FAILED: Used out-of-range words: " + outWords + ". MUST ONLY use allowed list. Regenerate.";
        // 簡單重試邏輯
        throw new Error('Out of range: ' + outWords);
      }
    }

    // 成功，寫入快取
    const cacheData = {
      questionEn: result.questionEn,
      questionCn: result.questionCn || currentWordEntry.quiz.questionCn,
      options: result.options,
      correctIndex: result.correctIndex,
      explanationEn: result.explanationEn,
      explanationCn: result.explanationCn,
      grammarPoint: result.grammarPoint || currentWordEntry.grammar.title,
      hintCn: result.hintCn || currentWordEntry.quiz.hintCn,
      expectedAnswer: result.options[result.correctIndex],
      source: modelToUse,
      timestamp: Date.now()
    };

    quizCache.set(cacheKey, cacheData);
    try {
      localStorage.setItem(cacheKey, JSON.stringify({ data: cacheData, timestamp: Date.now() }));
    } catch (e) {}

    addSystemLog('✅ Gemini 出題成功: ' + result.grammarPoint, false);
    return cacheData;

  } catch (error) {
    if (error.name === 'AbortError') {
      addSystemLog('⚠️ Gemini 出題已中斷', false);
      return null;
    }
    addSystemLog('❌ Gemini 出題失敗: ' + error.message + '，回退到題庫模式', true);
    // 回退到本地題庫
    return null;
  }
}


async function renderChoiceMode(quiz) {
  const choiceContainer = document.getElementById("choice-container");
  const dialogueContainer = document.getElementById("dialogue-container");
  if (choiceContainer) choiceContainer.style.display = "block";
  if (dialogueContainer) dialogueContainer.style.display = "none";
  
  const optionsDiv = document.getElementById("choice-options");
  const feedbackDiv = document.getElementById("quiz-feedback");
  
  // 顯示 Gemini 出題中狀態
  optionsDiv.innerHTML = `
    <div class="gemini-loading">
      <div class="loading-spinner"></div>
      <div class="loading-text">
        <strong>🤖 Gemini Flash 3.8 出題中...</strong>
        <span>針對 ${currentWord.word} / ${currentWord.grammar.title} 生成文法考題</span>
        <small>嚴格鎖定 Oxford Grade 4 LevelUp 範圍</small>
      </div>
    </div>
  `;
  if (feedbackDiv) feedbackDiv.innerHTML = "";

  let geminiQuiz = null;
  
  // 如果有 API Key，優先使用 Gemini
  if (hasApiKey()) {
    try {
      geminiQuiz = await generateQuizWithGemini(currentWord);
    } catch (e) {
      console.log("Gemini failed", e);
    }
  } else {
    addSystemLog('⚠️ 未設定 API Key，使用題庫出題。設定後可啟用 Gemini 3.8 智慧出題', true);
  }

  if (geminiQuiz) {
    // 使用 Gemini 生成的題目
    currentChoices = geminiQuiz.options;
    // 更新問句為 Gemini 生成的
    const qEn = document.getElementById("quiz-question-en");
    const qCn = document.getElementById("quiz-question-cn");
    const hint = document.getElementById("quiz-hint");
    if (qEn) qEn.innerHTML = geminiQuiz.questionEn + ' <span class="ai-badge">✨ Gemini 3.8</span>';
    if (qCn) qCn.innerText = geminiQuiz.questionCn || '';
    if (hint) hint.innerText = '💡 提示：' + geminiQuiz.hintCn + ' | 📝 考點：' + geminiQuiz.grammarPoint;
    
    // 更新 currentQuiz 以便判分
    currentQuiz = {
      ...currentQuiz,
      question: geminiQuiz.questionEn,
      questionCn: geminiQuiz.questionCn,
      expectedAnswer: geminiQuiz.options[geminiQuiz.correctIndex],
      hintCn: geminiQuiz.hintCn,
      explanationEn: geminiQuiz.explanationEn,
      explanationCn: geminiQuiz.explanationCn,
      grammarPoint: geminiQuiz.grammarPoint,
      isGemini: true,
      geminiData: geminiQuiz
    };
    
    optionsDiv.innerHTML = "";
    currentChoices.forEach((choice, idx) => {
      const btn = document.createElement("button");
      btn.className = "choice-btn gemini-choice";
      btn.innerHTML = `<span class="choice-label">${String.fromCharCode(65+idx)}</span> ${choice} <span class="choice-speak" data-text="${choice.replace(/"/g,'&quot;')}">🔊</span>`;
      btn.addEventListener("click", () => handleChoiceSelectGemini(choice, idx, btn, geminiQuiz));
      const speakSpan = btn.querySelector(".choice-speak");
      speakSpan.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
        e.stopPropagation();
        speakText(choice);
      });
      optionsDiv.appendChild(btn);
    });
    
    addSystemLog('🎯 已載入 Gemini 題目: ' + geminiQuiz.grammarPoint, false);
  } else {
    // 回退到題庫模式
    currentChoices = generateChoices(quiz);
    optionsDiv.innerHTML = "";
    
    currentChoices.forEach((choice, idx) => {
      const btn = document.createElement("button");
      btn.className = "choice-btn";
      btn.innerHTML = `<span class="choice-label">${String.fromCharCode(65+idx)}</span> ${choice} <span class="choice-speak" data-text="${choice.replace(/"/g,'&quot;')}">🔊</span>`;
      btn.addEventListener("click", () => handleChoiceSelect(choice, btn));
      const speakSpan = btn.querySelector(".choice-speak");
      speakSpan.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
        e.stopPropagation();
        speakText(choice);
      });
      optionsDiv.appendChild(btn);
    });
    
    if (!hasApiKey()) {
      const info = document.createElement("div");
      info.className = "choice-info fallback-info";
      info.innerHTML = "💡 目前為題庫模式，設定 API Key 後可啟用 🤖 Gemini Flash 3.8 智慧文法出題";
      optionsDiv.appendChild(info);
    }
  }
}

function handleChoiceSelectGemini(selected, selectedIdx, btnElement, geminiData) {
  const correctIdx = geminiData.correctIndex;
  const correct = geminiData.options[correctIdx];
  const isCorrect = selectedIdx === correctIdx;
  const allBtns = document.querySelectorAll(".choice-btn");
  allBtns.forEach(b => b.disabled = true);
  
  const feedbackDiv = document.getElementById("quiz-feedback");
  
  if (isCorrect) {
    btnElement.classList.add("correct");
    feedbackDiv.innerHTML = `
      <div class="feedback correct">
        <div class="feedback-title">✅ 答對了！ / Correct! <span class="ai-badge">Gemini 3.8</span></div>
        <div class="en-text">${geminiData.explanationEn}</div>
        <div class="cn-text">${geminiData.explanationCn}</div>
        <div class="grammar-point">📝 文法考點：${geminiData.grammarPoint}</div>
      </div>
    `;
    speakText("Correct! Great job! " + correct);
  } else {
    btnElement.classList.add("wrong");
    allBtns.forEach((b, idx) => {
      if (idx === correctIdx) b.classList.add("correct");
    });
    
    feedbackDiv.innerHTML = `
      <div class="feedback wrong">
        <div class="feedback-title">❌ 再試試 / Try Again <span class="ai-badge">Gemini 3.8</span></div>
        <div class="en-text">You chose: ${selected}</div>
        <div class="cn-text">你選的是：${selected}</div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px;">
          <strong>正確答案 / Correct Answer:</strong>
          <div class="correct-answer">${correct}</div>
          <div class="cn-text">💡 ${geminiData.explanationCn}</div>
          <div class="en-text" style="margin-top:8px; font-size:13px; color:#666;">${geminiData.explanationEn}</div>
          <div class="grammar-point" style="margin-top:8px;">📝 文法考點：${geminiData.grammarPoint}</div>
          <button id="btn-speak-correct" class="btn-small" style="margin-top:8px;">🔊 聽正確發音</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    `;
    const speakBtn = document.getElementById("btn-speak-correct");
    if (speakBtn) speakBtn.addEventListener("click", () => speakText(correct));
  }
  addSystemLog('[Gemini 3.8] 選擇: ' + selected + ' | 正確: ' + correct + ' | 結果: ' + (isCorrect ? '對' : '錯') + ' | 考點: ' + geminiData.grammarPoint);
}


function renderDialogueMode() {
  const choiceContainer = document.getElementById("choice-container");
  const dialogueContainer = document.getElementById("dialogue-container");
  if (choiceContainer) choiceContainer.style.display = "none";
  if (dialogueContainer) dialogueContainer.style.display = "block";
}

function handleChoiceSelect(selected, btnElement) {
  const correct = currentQuiz.expectedAnswer;
  const isCorrect = normalizeAnswer(selected) === normalizeAnswer(correct);
  const allBtns = document.querySelectorAll(".choice-btn");
  allBtns.forEach(b => b.disabled = true);
  
  const feedbackDiv = document.getElementById("quiz-feedback");
  
  if (isCorrect) {
    btnElement.classList.add("correct");
    feedbackDiv.innerHTML = `
      <div class="feedback correct">
        <div class="feedback-title">✅ 答對了！ / Correct!</div>
        <div class="en-text">Great job! ${correct}</div>
        <div class="cn-text">答對了！文法完全正確 / 提示：${currentQuiz.hintCn}</div>
      </div>
    `;
    speakText("Correct! Great job! " + correct);
  } else {
    btnElement.classList.add("wrong");
    // 標出正確的
    allBtns.forEach(b => {
      if (normalizeAnswer(b.textContent) === normalizeAnswer(correct) || b.innerText.includes(correct)) {
        // 用文字比對
        if (b.innerText.includes(correct.substring(0,10))) b.classList.add("correct");
      }
    });
    // 更精確：比對選項
    allBtns.forEach(b => {
      const txt = b.innerText.replace(/^[A-D]\s/, '').replace('🔊','').trim();
      if (normalizeAnswer(txt) === normalizeAnswer(correct)) b.classList.add("correct");
    });
    
    feedbackDiv.innerHTML = `
      <div class="feedback wrong">
        <div class="feedback-title">❌ 再試試 / Try Again</div>
        <div class="en-text">You chose: ${selected}</div>
        <div class="cn-text">你選的是：${selected}</div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px;">
          <strong>正確答案 / Correct Answer:</strong>
          <div class="correct-answer">${correct}</div>
          <div class="cn-text">💡 提示：${currentQuiz.hintCn}</div>
          <button id="btn-speak-correct" class="btn-small" style="margin-top:8px;">🔊 聽正確發音</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    `;
    const speakBtn = document.getElementById("btn-speak-correct");
    if (speakBtn) speakBtn.addEventListener("click", () => speakText(correct));
  }
  addSystemLog('[選擇題] 選擇: ' + selected + ' | 正確: ' + correct + ' | 結果: ' + (isCorrect ? '對' : '錯'));
}

// ==========================================
// 3. API 設定 - 安全版
// ==========================================
const TTS_MODEL = "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts";
const TEXT_MODEL = "gemini-2.5-flash";

function getApiKey() {
  let key = localStorage.getItem('GEMINI_API_KEY');
  if (key) return key;
  return "";
}
function hasApiKey() {
  return !!localStorage.getItem('GEMINI_API_KEY');
}
function promptForApiKey() {
  const existing = localStorage.getItem('GEMINI_API_KEY') || "";
  const input = prompt(`請輸入你的 Gemini API Key (只會存在你的瀏覽器，不會上傳到 GitHub)\n可在 https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey 取得\n\n目前: ${existing ? existing.slice(0,8)+'...' : '未設定'}`, existing);
  if (input !== null) {
    const trimmed = input.trim();
    if (trimmed) {
      localStorage.setItem('GEMINI_API_KEY', trimmed);
      alert('✅ API Key 已儲存到本機瀏覽器！');
      location.reload();
    }
  }
}
function getApiUrl(model) {
  const key = getApiKey();
  if (key) {
    return `https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/${model}:generateContent?key=${key}`;
  }
  return `/api/gemini?model=${model}`;
}

// ==========================================
// 全域音訊管理 + iPhone 兼容
// ==========================================
let currentAudio = null;
let currentAudioUrl = null;
let currentTtsAbortController = null;
let availableVoices = [];
let voicesLoaded = false;
let audioUnlocked = false;
let isIOS = /iPad|iPhone|iPod/.test(navigator.userAgent) || (navigator.platform === 'MacIntel' && navigator.maxTouchPoints > 1);

function isIOSDevice() {
  return isIOS;
}

function loadVoices() {
  return new Promise((resolve) => {
    const voices = window.speechSynthesis.getVoices();
    if (voices.length > 0) {
      availableVoices = voices;
      voicesLoaded = true;
      resolve(voices);
      return;
    }
    // iPhone 需要等 voiceschanged 事件
    const onVoicesChanged = () => {
      availableVoices = window.speechSynthesis.getVoices();
      if (availableVoices.length > 0) {
        voicesLoaded = true;
        window.speechSynthesis.removeEventListener('voiceschanged', onVoicesChanged);
        resolve(availableVoices);
      }
    };
    window.speechSynthesis.addEventListener('voiceschanged', onVoicesChanged);
    // 超時保護
    setTimeout(() => {
      availableVoices = window.speechSynthesis.getVoices();
      voicesLoaded = true;
      resolve(availableVoices);
    }, 1000);
  });
}

function getBestVoice(lang) {
  if (!availableVoices || availableVoices.length === 0) {
    availableVoices = window.speechSynthesis.getVoices();
  }
  // 優先找完全匹配
  let voice = availableVoices.find(v => v.lang === lang);
  if (voice) return voice;
  // 找語言前綴匹配，例如 en-US 匹配 en
  const langPrefix = lang.split('-')[0];
  voice = availableVoices.find(v => v.lang.startsWith(langPrefix));
  if (voice) return voice;
  // 找英文語音
  voice = availableVoices.find(v => v.lang.includes('en-'));
  if (voice) return voice;
  // 返回第一個
  return availableVoices[0] || null;
}

function unlockAudio() {
  if (audioUnlocked) return;
  addSystemLog('🔓 嘗試解鎖音訊 (iPhone 兼容)');
  try {
    // 解鎖 Web Audio API
    const AudioContext = window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext;
    if (AudioContext) {
      const ctx = new AudioContext();
      if (ctx.state === 'suspended') {
        ctx.resume();
      }
      // 播放無聲音頻
      const buffer = ctx.createBuffer(1, 1, 22050);
      const source = ctx.createBufferSource();
      source.buffer = buffer;
      source.connect(ctx.destination);
      source.start(0);
    }
    // 解鎖 speechSynthesis
    if ('speechSynthesis' in window) {
      window.speechSynthesis.cancel();
      // iPhone 需要先 resume
      if (window.speechSynthesis.paused) {
        window.speechSynthesis.resume();
      }
      // 播放空語句來解鎖
      const utterance = new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(' ');
      utterance.volume = 0;
      window.speechSynthesis.speak(utterance);
    }
    // 解鎖 Audio 標籤
    if (!currentAudio) {
      currentAudio = new Audio();
      currentAudio.playsInline = true;
      currentAudio.muted = true;
      currentAudio.play().then(() => {
        currentAudio.pause();
        currentAudio.muted = false;
      }).catch(() => {});
    }
    audioUnlocked = true;
    addSystemLog('✅ 音訊已解鎖');
  } catch (e) {
    addSystemLog('⚠️ 音訊解鎖失敗: ' + e.message, true);
  }
}

function stopCurrentAudio() {
  if ('speechSynthesis' in window) {
    window.speechSynthesis.cancel();
    // iPhone 上 cancel 後需要 resume 才能下一次播放
    if (isIOSDevice()) {
      setTimeout(() => {
        if (window.speechSynthesis.paused) {
          window.speechSynthesis.resume();
        }
      }, 50);
    }
  }
  if (currentAudio) {
    try { 
      currentAudio.pause(); 
      currentAudio.src = ""; 
      currentAudio.load(); 
    } catch (e) {}
    currentAudio = null;
  }
  if (currentAudioUrl) {
    try { URL.revokeObjectURL(currentAudioUrl); } catch (e) {}
    currentAudioUrl = null;
  }
  if (currentTtsAbortController) {
    try { currentTtsAbortController.abort(); } catch (e) {}
    currentTtsAbortController = null;
  }
  setVoiceButtonsPlaying(false);
}

function setVoiceButtonsPlaying(isPlaying) {
  const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('#btn-speak-word, #btn-speak-example, #btn-speak-grammar, #btn-speak-quiz, #btn-speak-correct');
  buttons.forEach(function(btn) {
    if (!btn) return;
    if (isPlaying) {
      if (!btn.dataset.originalText) btn.dataset.originalText = btn.innerText;
      btn.classList.add('playing');
      if (btn.id && btn.id.startsWith('btn-speak')) btn.innerText = '⏸️ 播放中...';
      btn.disabled = true;
    } else {
      btn.classList.remove('playing');
      if (btn.dataset.originalText) {
        btn.innerText = btn.dataset.originalText;
        delete btn.dataset.originalText;
      }
      btn.disabled = false;
    }
  });
}

function addSystemLog(message, isError) {
  isError = isError || false;
  const logBox = document.getElementById("system-log-box");
  if (!logBox) return;
  const timeStr = new Date().toLocaleTimeString();
  const colorStyle = isError ? "color: #ff4444;" : "color: #00ff66;";
  logBox.innerHTML += '<div style="' + colorStyle + '">[' + timeStr + '] ' + message + '</div>';
  logBox.scrollTop = logBox.scrollHeight;
}

// 工具
function base64ToBytes(base64) {
  const binary = atob(base64);
  const bytes = new Uint8Array(binary.length);
  for (let i = 0; i < binary.length; i++) bytes[i] = binary.charCodeAt(i);
  return bytes;
}
function pcmToWavBlob(pcmBytes, sampleRate) {
  sampleRate = sampleRate || 24000;
  const numChannels = 1;
  const bitsPerSample = 16;
  const byteRate = sampleRate * numChannels * bitsPerSample / 8;
  const blockAlign = numChannels * bitsPerSample / 8;
  const wavHeader = new ArrayBuffer(44);
  const view = new DataView(wavHeader);
  view.setUint32(0, 0x52494646, false);
  view.setUint32(4, 36 + pcmBytes.length, true);
  view.setUint32(8, 0x57415645, false);
  view.setUint32(12, 0x666d7420, false);
  view.setUint32(16, 16, true);
  view.setUint16(20, 1, true);
  view.setUint16(22, numChannels, true);
  view.setUint32(24, sampleRate, true);
  view.setUint32(28, byteRate, true);
  view.setUint16(32, blockAlign, true);
  view.setUint16(34, bitsPerSample, true);
  view.setUint32(36, 0x64617461, false);
  view.setUint32(40, pcmBytes.length, true);
  return new Blob([wavHeader, pcmBytes], { type: 'audio/wav' });
}
async function playGeminiAudio(base64Audio, mimeType) {
  stopCurrentAudio();
  const bytes = base64ToBytes(base64Audio);
  let audioBlob;
  if (mimeType.indexOf('wav') !== -1 || mimeType.indexOf('WAV') !== -1) {
    audioBlob = new Blob([bytes], { type: 'audio/wav' });
  } else {
    let sampleRate = 24000;
    const m = mimeType.match(/rate=(\d+)/);
    if (m) sampleRate = parseInt(m[1]);
    audioBlob = pcmToWavBlob(bytes, sampleRate);
  }
  currentAudioUrl = URL.createObjectURL(audioBlob);
  currentAudio = new Audio(currentAudioUrl);
  currentAudio.playsInline = true; // iPhone 必需
  currentAudio.preload = 'auto';
  currentAudio.onplay = function() { addSystemLog('▶️ 雲端語音開始播放'); setVoiceButtonsPlaying(true); };
  currentAudio.onended = function() { addSystemLog('✅ 播放完成'); setVoiceButtonsPlaying(false); if (currentAudioUrl) { try { URL.revokeObjectURL(currentAudioUrl); } catch (e) {} currentAudioUrl = null; } currentAudio = null; };
  currentAudio.onerror = function(e) { addSystemLog('❌ 播放錯誤: ' + e, true); setVoiceButtonsPlaying(false); currentAudio = null; };
  try {
    await currentAudio.play();
  } catch (e) {
    // iPhone 自動播放被阻擋，需要使用者手勢
    addSystemLog('⚠️ 自動播放被阻擋，請手動點擊播放按鈕: ' + e.message, true);
    setVoiceButtonsPlaying(false);
    // 顯示提示
    const feedback = document.getElementById("quiz-feedback");
    if (feedback && isIOSDevice()) {
      feedback.innerHTML += '<div class="feedback wrong" style="margin-top:8px;"><div class="cn-text">📱 iPhone 提示：請點擊 🔊 按鈕手動播放，自動播放已被系統阻擋。請先點一下畫面任意處解鎖音訊。</div></div>';
    }
    throw e;
  }
}

async function speakLocal(text, lang, rate) {
  if (!('speechSynthesis' in window)) {
    addSystemLog('❌ 瀏覽器不支援 speechSynthesis', true);
    return false;
  }
  
  // 確保 voices 已載入
  if (!voicesLoaded) {
    await loadVoices();
  }
  
  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
    try {
      // iPhone 特殊處理：必須先 cancel 再 resume
      window.speechSynthesis.cancel();
      
      // 等待一下讓 cancel 生效
      setTimeout(() => {
        if (window.speechSynthesis.paused) {
          window.speechSynthesis.resume();
        }
        
        const utterance = new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(text);
        const voice = getBestVoice(lang);
        
        if (voice) {
          utterance.voice = voice;
          addSystemLog('🎤 使用語音: ' + voice.name + ' (' + voice.lang + ')');
        } else {
          addSystemLog('⚠️ 未找到匹配語音，使用預設，lang=' + lang);
        }
        
        utterance.lang = lang;
        utterance.rate = rate || 1;
        utterance.volume = 1;
        utterance.pitch = 1;
        
        utterance.onstart = function() { 
          addSystemLog('▶️ 本地語音開始播放: ' + text.substring(0,30));
          setVoiceButtonsPlaying(true); 
        };
        utterance.onend = function() { 
          addSystemLog('✅ 本地播放完成'); 
          setVoiceButtonsPlaying(false);
          resolve(true);
        };
        utterance.onerror = function(e) { 
          addSystemLog('❌ 本地語音錯誤: ' + e.error, true); 
          setVoiceButtonsPlaying(false);
          // iPhone 常見錯誤：interrupted, canceled
          if (e.error === 'interrupted' || e.error === 'canceled') {
            addSystemLog('⚠️ iPhone 語音被中斷，嘗試恢復...', true);
            // 不算失敗，可能是被新的 cancel 打斷
            resolve(false);
          } else {
            reject(e);
          }
        };
        
        window.speechSynthesis.speak(utterance);
        
        // iPhone 需要額外的 resume 觸發
        if (isIOSDevice() && window.speechSynthesis.paused) {
          setTimeout(() => {
            window.speechSynthesis.resume();
          }, 100);
        }
      }, 100);
    } catch (e) {
      addSystemLog('❌ speakLocal 例外: ' + e.message, true);
      reject(e);
    }
  });
}

async function speakText(text, forceLocal) {
  if (!text) return;
  
  // iPhone 上第一次需要解鎖
  if (!audioUnlocked && isIOSDevice()) {
    unlockAudio();
  }
  
  stopCurrentAudio();
  const engineSelect = document.getElementById("tts-engine-select");
  const engine = engineSelect ? engineSelect.value : "local";
  const accentSelect = document.getElementById("accent-select");
  const lang = accentSelect ? accentSelect.value : "en-US";
  const rateSlider = document.getElementById("rate-slider");
  const rate = rateSlider ? parseFloat(rateSlider.value) : 1;
  
  addSystemLog('準備發音 [' + engine + ']：' + text);
  
  // 如果強制本地或引擎是本地
  if (engine === "local" || forceLocal) {
    try {
      await speakLocal(text, lang, rate);
    } catch (e) {
      addSystemLog('❌ 本地發音失敗，嘗試雲端: ' + e.message, true);
      // 如果本地失敗且有 API Key，嘗試雲端
      if (hasApiKey() && !forceLocal) {
        await speakTextGemini(text);
      }
    }
  } else {
    // Gemini 雲端
    await speakTextGemini(text);
  }
}

async function speakTextGemini(text) {
  const requestBody = {
    contents: [{ parts: [{ text: text }] }],
    generationConfig: {
      responseModalities: ["AUDIO"],
      speechConfig: { voiceConfig: { prebuiltVoiceConfig: { voiceName: "Puck" } } }
    }
  };
  try {
    currentTtsAbortController = new AbortController();
    const url = getApiUrl(TTS_MODEL);
    if (!hasApiKey() && url.startsWith('/api')) {
      const response = await fetch(url, {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify(requestBody),
        signal: currentTtsAbortController.signal
      });
      const data = await response.json();
      if (!response.ok) throw new Error(data.error?.message || "代理請求失敗");
      const parts = data.candidates && data.candidates[0] && data.candidates[0].content && data.candidates[0].content.parts ? data.candidates[0].content.parts : [];
      const audioPart = parts.find(function(p) { return p.inlineData && p.inlineData.mimeType && p.inlineData.mimeType.indexOf('audio') !== -1; });
      if (audioPart) await playGeminiAudio(audioPart.inlineData.data, audioPart.inlineData.mimeType);
      return;
    }
    const response = await fetch(url, {
      method: 'POST',
      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
      body: JSON.stringify(requestBody),
      signal: currentTtsAbortController.signal
    });
    addSystemLog('API 回應狀態: ' + response.status);
    const data = await response.json();
    if (!response.ok) {
      if (response.status === 400 && !hasApiKey()) throw new Error("未設定 API Key。請點選右上角「設定 API Key」");
      throw new Error(data.error?.message || "API 請求失敗");
    }
    const parts = data.candidates && data.candidates[0] && data.candidates[0].content && data.candidates[0].content.parts ? data.candidates[0].content.parts : [];
    const audioPart = parts.find(function(p) { return p.inlineData && p.inlineData.mimeType && p.inlineData.mimeType.indexOf('audio') !== -1; });
    if (audioPart) {
      await playGeminiAudio(audioPart.inlineData.data, audioPart.inlineData.mimeType);
    } else {
      addSystemLog("⚠️ API 回應中未包含音訊資料", true);
      setVoiceButtonsPlaying(false);
      // 回退到本地
      await speakLocal(text, document.getElementById("accent-select").value, parseFloat(document.getElementById("rate-slider").value));
    }
  } catch (error) {
    if (error.name === 'AbortError') {
      addSystemLog('⚠️ 已中斷前一個請求', false);
    } else {
      addSystemLog('❌ 語音合成錯誤: ' + error.message, true);
      setVoiceButtonsPlaying(false);
      if (error.message.includes('API Key')) {
        alert(error.message);
      } else if (isIOSDevice()) {
        // iPhone 自動播放被阻擋，回退到本地
        addSystemLog('🔄 嘗試回退到本地語音...', false);
        try {
          await speakLocal(text, document.getElementById("accent-select").value, parseFloat(document.getElementById("rate-slider").value));
        } catch (e) {
          addSystemLog('❌ 本地回退也失敗: ' + e.message, true);
        }
      }
    }
  }
}

function normalizeAnswer(str) {
  return str.toLowerCase().replace(/[.,!?]/g,'').replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim();
}
async function checkAnswerWithAI(userTranscript) {
  if (!currentQuiz) return;
  const q = currentQuiz.question;
  const expected = currentQuiz.expectedAnswer;
  const hint = currentQuiz.hintCn;
  appendChatLog("你說", userTranscript, "user");
  const rs = document.getElementById("record-status");
  if (rs) rs.innerText = "AI 判斷中...";
  const normUser = normalizeAnswer(userTranscript);
  const normExpected = normalizeAnswer(expected);
  const isExactMatch = normUser === normExpected;
  const prompt = `
You are an English grammar checker for elementary students.
Question: "${q}"
Expected exact answer: "${expected}"
Hint: "${hint}"
Student said: "${userTranscript}"
Rules: Be STRICT. Return ONLY JSON: {"isCorrect": ${isExactMatch}, "correctText": "${expected}", "feedbackEn": "...", "feedbackCn": "...", "pronunciationNote": "" }
`;
  try {
    currentTtsAbortController = new AbortController();
    const url = getApiUrl(TEXT_MODEL);
    let response;
    if (!hasApiKey() && url.startsWith('/api')) {
      response = await fetch(url, {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify({ contents: [{ parts: [{ text: prompt }] }] }),
        signal: currentTtsAbortController.signal
      });
    } else {
      response = await fetch(url, {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify({ contents: [{ parts: [{ text: prompt }] }] }),
        signal: currentTtsAbortController.signal
      });
    }
    const data = await response.json();
    if (!response.ok) throw new Error(data.error?.message || "AI 判斷失敗");
    let text = data.candidates[0].content.parts[0].text;
    text = text.replace(/```json/g,'').replace(/```/g,'').trim();
    let result;
    try { result = JSON.parse(text); } catch (e) {
      result = {
        isCorrect: isExactMatch,
        correctText: expected,
        feedbackEn: isExactMatch ? "Correct! Great job!" : "Please check grammar. Expected: " + expected,
        feedbackCn: isExactMatch ? "答對了！文法完全正確" : "請檢查文法，要和正確答案完全一樣。正確答案：" + expected,
        pronunciationNote: ""
      };
    }
    const feedbackDiv = document.getElementById("quiz-feedback");
    if (result.isCorrect) {
      feedbackDiv.innerHTML = `<div class="feedback correct"><div class="feedback-title">✅ 正確！ / Correct!</div><div class="en-text">${result.feedbackEn}</div><div class="cn-text">${result.feedbackCn}</div></div>`;
      appendChatLog("AI 老師", result.feedbackEn + " / " + result.feedbackCn, "ai");
      speakText(result.feedbackEn);
    } else {
      feedbackDiv.innerHTML = `<div class="feedback wrong"><div class="feedback-title">❌ 再試試 / Try Again</div><div class="en-text">${result.feedbackEn}</div><div class="cn-text">${result.feedbackCn}</div><div style="margin-top:12px;"><strong>正確答案 / Correct Answer:</strong><div class="correct-answer">${result.correctText}</div><div class="cn-text">💡 提示：${hint}</div><button id="btn-speak-correct" class="btn-small" style="margin-top:8px;">🔊 聽正確發音</button></div>${result.pronunciationNote ? `<div class="pronunciation-note">🎤 發音提示：${result.pronunciationNote}</div>` : ''}</div>`;
      const btn = document.getElementById("btn-speak-correct");
      if (btn) btn.addEventListener("click", () => speakText(result.correctText));
      appendChatLog("AI 老師", "正確答案是: " + result.correctText + " / " + result.feedbackCn, "ai");
    }
    if (rs) rs.innerText = "判斷完成";
  } catch (error) {
    if (error.name !== 'AbortError') {
      const feedbackDiv = document.getElementById("quiz-feedback");
      if (isExactMatch) {
        feedbackDiv.innerHTML = `<div class="feedback correct"><div class="feedback-title">✅ 正確！</div><div class="en-text">Correct! Great job!</div><div class="cn-text">答對了！文法完全正確</div></div>`;
        speakText("Correct! Great job!");
      } else {
        feedbackDiv.innerHTML = `<div class="feedback wrong"><div class="feedback-title">❌ 不正確</div><div class="en-text">Expected: ${expected}</div><div class="cn-text">正確答案：${expected}<br>提示：${hint}</div><button id="btn-speak-correct" class="btn-small">🔊 聽正確發音</button></div>`;
        const btn = document.getElementById("btn-speak-correct");
        if (btn) btn.addEventListener("click", () => speakText(expected));
      }
    }
  }
}
function appendChatLog(sender, text, type) {
  const chatLog = document.getElementById("chat-log");
  if (!chatLog) return;
  chatLog.innerHTML += '<div class="chat-msg ' + type + '"><strong>' + sender + ':</strong> ' + text + '</div>';
  chatLog.scrollTop = chatLog.scrollHeight;
}
let recognition = null;
const SpeechRecognition = window.SpeechRecognition || window.webkitSpeechRecognition;
if (SpeechRecognition) {
  recognition = new SpeechRecognition();
  recognition.lang = 'en-US';
  recognition.interimResults = false;
  recognition.onstart = function() {
    const rs = document.getElementById("record-status");
    if (rs) rs.innerText = "聆聽中...";
    const btn = document.getElementById("btn-record");
    if (btn) btn.classList.add("recording");
  };
  recognition.onresult = function(e) {
    const rs = document.getElementById("record-status");
    if (rs) rs.innerText = "辨識完成";
    checkAnswerWithAI(e.results[0][0].transcript);
  };
  recognition.onend = function() { 
    const btn = document.getElementById("btn-record");
    if (btn) btn.classList.remove("recording");
  };
}
document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function() {
  // iPhone 兼容：預載語音 + 解鎖音訊
  if ('speechSynthesis' in window) {
    loadVoices().then(voices => {
      addSystemLog('🎤 語音已載入: ' + voices.length + ' 個, iOS=' + isIOSDevice());
      if (isIOSDevice()) {
        addSystemLog('📱 偵測到 iPhone/iPad，請點擊任意按鈕後再點 🔊 才能發音', false);
      }
    });
  }
  // 解鎖音訊：iPhone 需要使用者手勢
  const unlockHandler = () => {
    if (!audioUnlocked) {
      unlockAudio();
    }
  };
  document.addEventListener('touchstart', unlockHandler, { once: true });
  document.addEventListener('click', unlockHandler, { once: true });
  document.addEventListener('touchend', unlockHandler, { once: true });

  // iPhone 專用橫幅
  const iosBanner = document.getElementById('ios-audio-banner');
  const btnEnable = document.getElementById('btn-enable-audio');
  const audioStatus = document.getElementById('audio-status');
  if (isIOSDevice() && iosBanner) {
    iosBanner.style.display = 'block';
    if (audioStatus) audioStatus.innerText = '等待啟用...';
  }
  if (btnEnable) {
    btnEnable.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      if (audioStatus) audioStatus.innerText = '啟用中...';
      unlockAudio();
      // 嘗試播放測試音
      try {
        await loadVoices();
        await speakLocal('Hello, audio enabled', 'en-US', 1);
        if (audioStatus) audioStatus.innerText = '✅ 語音已啟用！現在可以點 🔊 聽發音了';
        btnEnable.innerText = '✅ 已啟用';
        btnEnable.style.background = '#34a853';
        btnEnable.style.color = 'white';
        setTimeout(() => {
          if (iosBanner) iosBanner.style.display = 'none';
        }, 2000);
        addSystemLog('✅ iPhone 語音啟用成功');
      } catch (e) {
        if (audioStatus) audioStatus.innerText = '❌ 啟用失敗: ' + e.message + '，請再點一次';
        addSystemLog('❌ iPhone 啟用失敗: ' + e.message, true);
      }
    });
  }
  
  // iPhone 上如果引擎是 local，自動切換提示
  if (isIOSDevice()) {
    const engineSelect = document.getElementById('tts-engine-select');
    if (engineSelect) {
      engineSelect.addEventListener('change', (e) => {
        if (e.target.value === 'local') {
          addSystemLog('📱 iPhone 本地語音：請確保已點擊啟用按鈕', false);
        } else {
          if (!hasApiKey()) {
            addSystemLog('⚠️ 雲端語音需要 API Key', true);
          }
        }
      });
    }
  }


  if (!hasApiKey()) {
    const logBox = document.getElementById("system-log-box");
    if (logBox) addSystemLog("⚠️ 未偵測到 API Key，請點選「設定 API Key」按鈕", true);
    const status = document.getElementById("api-status-text");
    if (status) { status.innerText = "⚠️ 未設定 API Key"; status.style.color = "#e53935"; }
  } else {
    const status = document.getElementById("api-status-text");
    if (status) { status.innerText = "✅ 已設定本地 Key"; status.style.color = "#2e7d32"; }
  }

  // 模式切換
  const btnChoice = document.getElementById("btn-mode-choice");
  const btnDialogue = document.getElementById("btn-mode-dialogue");
  if (btnChoice) {
    btnChoice.addEventListener("click", () => {
      quizMode = 'choice';
      btnChoice.classList.add("active");
      btnDialogue.classList.remove("active");
      if (currentQuiz) renderQuiz(currentQuiz);
      addSystemLog("[模式] 切換到選擇題模式");
    });
  }
  if (btnDialogue) {
    btnDialogue.addEventListener("click", () => {
      quizMode = 'dialogue';
      btnDialogue.classList.add("active");
      btnChoice.classList.remove("active");
      if (currentQuiz) renderQuiz(currentQuiz);
      addSystemLog("[模式] 切換到對答模式");
    });
  }

  loadNextWord();
  const nextBtn = document.getElementById("btn-next-word");
  if (nextBtn) nextBtn.addEventListener("click", loadNextWord);
  document.querySelectorAll('.unit-checkbox').forEach(function(cb) { cb.addEventListener("change", loadNextWord); });
  const rateSlider = document.getElementById("rate-slider");
  if (rateSlider) rateSlider.addEventListener("input", function(e) { document.getElementById("rate-display").innerText = e.target.value + 'x'; });
  const btnSpeakWord = document.getElementById("btn-speak-word");
  if (btnSpeakWord) btnSpeakWord.addEventListener("click", function() { speakText(currentWord.word); });
  const btnSpeakEx = document.getElementById("btn-speak-example");
  if (btnSpeakEx) btnSpeakEx.addEventListener("click", function() { speakText(currentWord.example); });
  const btnSpeakGram = document.getElementById("btn-speak-grammar");
  if (btnSpeakGram) btnSpeakGram.addEventListener("click", function() { if (currentWord.grammar) speakText(currentWord.grammar.content); });
  const btnSpeakQuiz = document.getElementById("btn-speak-quiz");
  if (btnSpeakQuiz) btnSpeakQuiz.addEventListener("click", function() { if (currentQuiz) speakText(currentQuiz.question); });
  const btnClear = document.getElementById("btn-clear-log");
  if (btnClear) btnClear.addEventListener("click", function() { document.getElementById("system-log-box").innerHTML = "[System] 紀錄已清除。"; });
  const btnSetKey = document.getElementById("btn-set-api-key");
  if (btnSetKey) btnSetKey.addEventListener("click", promptForApiKey);
  const btnTest = document.getElementById("btn-test-api");
  if (btnTest) btnTest.addEventListener("click", async function() {
    const statusText = document.getElementById("api-status-text");
    if (!hasApiKey()) { alert("請先設定 API Key"); promptForApiKey(); return; }
    statusText.innerText = "測試中...";
    statusText.style.color = "#1a73e8";
    addSystemLog("開始執行 API 連線測試...");
    try {
      stopCurrentAudio();
      currentTtsAbortController = new AbortController();
      const url = getApiUrl(TTS_MODEL);
      const response = await fetch(url, {
        method: "POST",
        headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
        body: JSON.stringify({ contents: [{ parts: [{ text: "Hello, this is a test." }] }], generationConfig: { responseModalities: ["AUDIO"], speechConfig: { voiceConfig: { prebuiltVoiceConfig: { voiceName: "Puck" } } } } }),
        signal: currentTtsAbortController.signal
      });
      const data = await response.json();
      if (response.ok) {
        statusText.innerText = "✅ API 連線成功！";
        statusText.style.color = "#2e7d32";
        addSystemLog("✅ API 連線測試成功 (Status 200)");
        const parts = data.candidates && data.candidates[0] && data.candidates[0].content && data.candidates[0].content.parts ? data.candidates[0].content.parts : [];
        const audioPart = parts.find(function(p) { return p.inlineData && p.inlineData.mimeType && p.inlineData.mimeType.indexOf('audio') !== -1; });
        if (audioPart) await playGeminiAudio(audioPart.inlineData.data, audioPart.inlineData.mimeType);
      } else {
        statusText.innerText = '❌ 失敗';
        statusText.style.color = "#e53935";
        addSystemLog('❌ API 測試失敗: ' + (data.error && data.error.message ? data.error.message : "未知錯誤"), true);
      }
    } catch (error) {
      if (error.name !== 'AbortError') {
        statusText.innerText = "❌ 網路異常";
        statusText.style.color = "#e53935";
        addSystemLog('❌ 網路例外錯誤: ' + error.message, true);
      }
    }
  });
  const btnRecord = document.getElementById("btn-record");
  if (btnRecord) btnRecord.addEventListener("click", function() {
    if (window.isSecureContext === false) { alert("請在 HTTPS 網址下執行語音辨識。"); return; }
    if (!recognition) { alert("瀏覽器不支援語音辨識。"); return; }
    if (!hasApiKey()) { alert("請先設定 API Key 才能使用 AI 判分"); promptForApiKey(); return; }
    try { recognition.start(); } catch (e) { addSystemLog('語音辨識啟動錯誤: ' + e.message, true); }
  });
});
